 "note_en": "A family photo in which almost nobody is looking at the camera turns out to be the happiest one, a good excuse to talk about the 全家福 (\"whole-family blessing\") tradition and the craze for beauty filters. Then comes a collection of viral family-photo mishaps: a bench collapsing at a village gathering, a cat leaping into the frame, a toddler turned into a red blur, a beauty filter that turns Grandpa into a pop idol, a cheeky retoucher's dinosaurs, and Dad falling into the shot during the self-timer.",
